1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC,
"Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:00,000
Where exactly
has she appeared before?

4
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,120
What's going on?

5
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,160
What's the situation inside?

6
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:11,080
Judging by the time,

7
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,360
he has already
checked the itinerary...

8
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:14,400
back to November of last year.

9
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:17,720
But based on his micro-expressions,

10
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:19,880
he still hasn't remembered.

11
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,760
Isn't that obvious?

12
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,520
If he remembered,
why would he be sitting in there?

13
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:26,120
I just like stating the obvious.

14
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:28,159
Look, one sentence can waste...

15
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,200
one sentence's worth of time.

16
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,240
It's very philosophical.
Since you're so wise,

17
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,920
why don't you tell Mr. Fu...

18
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,560
who Ruan Si Xian really is?

19
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,320
It's not like I haven't tried
to remind him.

20
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,400
But he won't listen.

21
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:41,919
Well, let me
enlighten you further...

22
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:43,040
on the philosophy of life.

23
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:45,439
People can't teach people anything,

24
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:46,440
but circumstances...

25
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:47,920
can teach them instantly.

26
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Got it?

27
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,120
When he needs me,

28
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,639
I'll enlighten him.

29
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,200
Bai Yang, come in for a moment.

30
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,040
Mr. Fu, any instructions?

31
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,520
I'm starting
to feel more and more...

32
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,240
that Ruan Si Xian's animosity...

33
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,680
is directed at me, not you.

34
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,120
What makes you think that?

35
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:19,960
Intuition.

36
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,480
Look, let me analyze it for you.

37
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,640
Please go ahead.

38
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,680
Ruan Si Xian's video...

39
00:03:23,681 --> 00:03:24,800
was sent to me by Yan An.

40
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,280
The offer Yan An gave her
wasn't bad.

41
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,880
Ruan Si Xian could have gone
straight to Bo'ao Airlines.

42
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,400
But...

43
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,160
No, wait.

44
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,400
How could Yan An be that smart?

45
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:43,160
So do you mean...

46
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,880
you think there is a catch?

47
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,400
Definitely.

48
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,680
(Episode 3: Is There a Catch?)

49
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:55,039
This small card is
for your internal account.

50
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:56,400
Other login passwords are
also on it.

51
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:58,640
Everything is there.
And this is the process sheet.

52
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,520
Take it to the Logistics Department
to collect your uniform.

53
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,999
(Human Resources Department,
Onboarding Details)

54
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,120
Actually, even now,

55
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,200
I still remember
my employee ID number.

56
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:11,280
Only the prefix letter...

57
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:13,960
has changed from E to D.

58
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,840
You're the pride of Hengshi Air.

59
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,680
Thank you.

60
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,680
Hello, who is this?

61
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:33,840
Ms. Ruan, it's me, Yan An.

62
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,320
Mr. Yan, is something the matter?

63
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:37,440
Nothing much.

64
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:39,120
I just wanted to ask...

65
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:40,800
if you've reported to Hengshi yet.

66
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,280
If not,

67
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,680
would you like to reconsider Bo'ao?

68
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,240
What a coincidence.

69
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,080
I just entered my personnel info.

70
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,560
Mr. Yan, thank you
for your kindness.

71
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:53,320
You were about to sign with Bo'ao.

72
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,280
Why did you go to Hengshi?

73
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,800
Well...

74
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:57,919
What did that fellow, Fu Ming Yu,

75
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,120
do to charm you?

76
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:01,000
Did he use his looks to seduce you?

77
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,200
Why would you say that, Mr. Yan?

78
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,400
Isn't it true?

79
00:05:04,401 --> 00:05:07,759
Fu Ming Yu loves
using that face of his...

80
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:08,880
to deceive people.

81
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:11,120
He has led many young women astray.

82
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:13,960
About Mr. Fu...

83
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,600
Well,

84
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,760
handsome,

85
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,560
dashing,

86
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,800
distinguished,

87
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,280
refined,

88
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:23,960
imposing,

89
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,999
suave,

90
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,080
and free-spirited...

91
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:28,760
are all things...

92
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,160
that have nothing to do with him.

93
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,040
Ms. Ruan,

94
00:05:35,041 --> 00:05:36,760
you're so honest!

95
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,919
I love being around
discerning people like you.

96
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,360
Mr. Yan, you seem very free lately.

97
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,239
If you have nothing to do,

98
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,480
you should think about...

99
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:44,760
your breakup.

100
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,039
After it was exposed,

101
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,600
it caused
a very negative social impact.

102
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,240
Stop trying to harass my employees.

103
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,800
And don't try to poach them.

104
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:56,120
Also, please
follow the industry rules.

105
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:58,120
I wouldn't mind taking over...

106
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,879
your Bali Tourism Contract.

107
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:01,600
Fu Ming Yu, haven't you
taken over enough already?

108
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,400
Ms. Ruan,

109
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:10,960
we meet again.

110
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,520
Welcome to Hengshi.

111
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,720
This should be
our second time meeting, right?

112
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,560
Is it the second time?

113
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,640
Ms. Ruan, you seem...

114
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,360
to know a lot about me.

115
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:49,520
Did you hear
what I just said, Mr. Fu?

116
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,999
I only heard it from others.

117
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,000
From whom?

118
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,200
A friend...

119
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:55,840
who wishes to remain anonymous.

120
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,720
Mr. Fu, sorry to interrupt,

121
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,200
but the meeting is about to start.

122
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:03,840
Mr. Fu.

123
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:08,040
- Is there anything else?
- I'm sorry about just now.

124
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:11,119
I shouldn't have
listened to those rumors...

125
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,120
and badmouthed you.

126
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,240
I should have gotten
to know you first.

127
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,320
Before badmouthing me?

128
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:22,400
I have things to do,
so I'll head out.

129
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:23,920
I need to go pick up my uniform.

130
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,920
When you're done with work,

131
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:28,320
remember to check your phone.

132
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,920
Here you go.

133
00:07:39,921 --> 00:07:41,160
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

134
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:43,520
I'll be going now.

135
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:49,200
Xiao Ruan.

136
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,160
Let me take that.

137
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,120
Thank you.

138
00:07:56,121 --> 00:07:57,880
You're welcome. Mr. Fu sent me.

139
00:07:58,320 --> 00:08:00,279
He was worried there would be
too many uniforms for you to carry.

140
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:01,280
He asked me to give you a hand.

141
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:06,240
Let's go. We can talk on the way.

142
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,200
Mr. Fu sent you?

143
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,880
He's being surprisingly nice.

144
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,240
So nice that it's making me uneasy.

145
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,880
I'll have to re-read my contract...

146
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,480
to make sure
there are no hidden clauses.

147
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,760
How could that be?

148
00:08:16,761 --> 00:08:18,320
A company like Hengshi
would never do such a thing.

149
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,160
Hengshi might not,

150
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:21,760
but I'm not so sure
about Fu Ming Yu.

151
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:23,880
I don't know why,

152
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,599
but I have a vague feeling...

153
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,800
that things aren't that simple.

154
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,600
Ms. Ruan,

155
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,120
about what happened three years ago,

156
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,920
it must have been
a small misunderstanding.

157
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,640
But look how great things are now.

158
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,640
Mr. Fu is so attentive to you.

159
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,400
Even being so attentive,

160
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:38,920
he still doesn't remember who I am.

161
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,360
His memory is so bad.

162
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:43,040
Doesn't our airline conduct
physicals?

163
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:48,799
Important people
have short memories.

164
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:50,040
Mr. Fu is usually very busy.

165
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:51,280
Let me give you a heads-up.

166
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,640
Tomorrow morning,

167
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:55,640
there's a new pilot photo shoot.

168
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,600
The Publicity Department
will notify you later.

169
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,360
So tonight, get a good rest.

170
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,600
Don't stay up late.

171
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,400
Stay in top form.

172
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,000
Let's go.

173
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,599
I just reviewed it.
Have Xiao Li check it again.

174
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:13,320
Okay, there are no problems.
You can head off first.

175
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,560
Okay.

176
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,480
Boss.

177
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:23,880
Smells pretty good.

178
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:27,080
Bring me all my itineraries
from last year.

179
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:32,920
Boss, do you want some?

180
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:36,040
Make it the last two years.

181
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:49,560
What's going on?

182
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,360
Isn't that Mr. Fu's assistant?

183
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,240
Why is he with Ruan Si Xian?

184
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:55,680
Let's go.

185
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,720
She's got some powerful connections.

186
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,160
Bai Yang, come in for a moment.

187
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:12,240
I'm starting
to feel more and more...

188
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:15,080
that Ruan Si Xian's hostility
is directed at me.

189
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:17,079
Ruan Si Xian getting first place...

190
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,839
was done for my sake.

191
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,120
So do you mean...

192
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,840
you think there is a catch?

193
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,320
Definitely.

194
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,680
Stab?

195
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,000
Scam?

196
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,480
Scumbag?

197
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,560
Mr. Fu, look.

198
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,240
I think...

199
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:34,640
it's time...

200
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:37,160
to use some tactics.

201
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,000
Has it really come to that?

202
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,520
Go to HR.

203
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,560
Pull up Ruan Si Xian's file.

204
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:54,000
Boss, you're amazing.

205
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,440
Let's go, Qiao Qiao. Quick!

206
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:01,159
Go to HR
and pull Ruan Si Xian's file.

207
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,160
Hurry!

208
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:04,360
Why are you so excited
over pulling a file?

209
00:11:16,280 --> 00:11:18,840
That's what you get
for stealing my project.

210
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:26,800
That's what you get
for being a hypocrite.

211
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:33,040
Stealing from me, are you?

212
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,040
What's wrong with you, Fu Ming Yu?

213
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,200
Can you shut up...

214
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:39,400
and focus?

215
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,440
No!

216
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,400
If I don't trash-talk you
while I work out,

217
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:46,280
can it even be called working out?

218
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,360
Right?

219
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:53,080
Ruan Si Xian was supposed
to join Bo'ao.

220
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:56,240
We would've hit it off
and started dating.

221
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,759
I even thought about...

222
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,760
which kindergarten
our kids would go to.

223
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:02,120
But you intercepted her.

224
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,480
But Mr. Fu,

225
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,720
I should actually thank you.

226
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:10,079
Now that Ruan Si Xian and I...

227
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:12,200
don't have
a professional connection,

228
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:14,400
we can date...

229
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,040
without any inhibitions.

230
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:25,240
I need to speed up our romance.

231
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,960
Ruan Si Xian.

232
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,000
Ms. Ruan,

233
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,600
are you free lately?

234
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,560
I'd like to invite you
for afternoon tea.

235
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:37,160
Vocal fry?

236
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,440
That's so fake.

237
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:40,280
It's called a sexy man's voice.

238
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,360
You have her WeChat?

239
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,480
I do.

240
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,120
Ruan...

241
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:52,320
Don't tell me someone...

242
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:55,400
doesn't have Ms. Ruan's WeChat yet?

243
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,800
Now I feel better.

244
00:12:57,801 --> 00:13:00,440
(Ruan Si Xian
Me: I am Fu Ming Yu.)

245
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,120
I'm a bit busy
since I just started my job.

246
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:12,320
Ms. Ruan, I'll wait for you.

247
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,840
I have plenty of time.

248
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,480
Mr. Fu, you're done?

249
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:18,600
Leaving already?

250
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:22,480
Ms. Ruan, I'll wait for you.

251
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:23,960
I have plenty of time.

252
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:29,119
(Notifications,
Recommended Friends, Fu Ming Yu)

253
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,479
(Accept Friend Request,
Name: Fu Ming Yu)

254
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:32,399
(Fu Ming Yu)

255
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:33,560
(Delete)

256
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:39,399
Why doesn't
the friend request system...

257
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:40,400
have a "Reject" option?

258
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:43,880
Not letting the other person
see the word "Reject"...

259
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,040
is such a shame.

260
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:46,999
If there was another option,

261
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,760
"Never accept requests
from this person,"

262
00:13:48,920 --> 00:13:49,920
that would be even better.
(Send)

263
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:51,920
(You're here to see me again.
Admit it. You like me!)

264
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:59,160
Maybe it's to protect
the other person's pride.

265
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:00,760
For someone like that,

266
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:01,920
just ignore them.

267
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,600
You're right.

268
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,840
I guess I didn't think it through.

269
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:29,920
Do you have any other orders?

270
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,480
What are you laughing at?

271
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:37,120
Nothing. I'm just looking at
Xiao Ruan's WeChat Moments.

272
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:38,920
It's quite funny and thoughtful.

273
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:40,960
What did she say?

274
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:42,640
See for yourself.

275
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,000
Well...

276
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,200
Why doesn't
the friend request system...
have a "Reject" option?

277
00:14:52,201 --> 00:14:53,799
Not letting the other person
see the word "Reject"...

278
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:54,800
It's such a shame.

279
00:14:54,801 --> 00:14:56,639
If there was another option, "Never
accept requests from this person,"

280
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:57,640
that would be even better.

281
00:14:57,641 --> 00:14:59,560
- Is that funny?
- It's not funny at all.

282
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:04,720
Did you tell her
about tomorrow's promotional shoot?

283
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,759
Zeng Yu has already
briefed Xiao Ruan...

284
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:08,320
on the promotional plan in detail.

285
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,560
Not a briefing.

286
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:10,880
A discussion.

287
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:14,240
Tell Zeng Yu to fully respect
Ruan Si Xian's opinion.

288
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:15,920
Understood.

289
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:23,680
Hello?

290
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,840
I know you've landed.

291
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,080
I've already
arranged a hotel for you.

292
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,399
Why would I stay in a hotel?

293
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:33,520
It's not like I don't have a home.

294
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:34,880
What's wrong with you?

295
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,840
I came all the way back to help you,

296
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,840
and you only sent a driver
to pick me up?

297
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,400
Wait until I rip you off tomorrow.

298
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:43,720
You won the bid...

299
00:15:43,721 --> 00:15:44,960
because of
your cost-effectiveness, right?

300
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:46,720
If you try to rip me off,

301
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:49,000
I'll have to reconsider.

302
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:53,120
Fine. Today, I'll let you
enjoy being the client.

303
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:54,280
Big Head Fu,

304
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:55,360
just you wait until tomorrow.

305
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,080
You're back quite late.

306
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,000
You're not early either, Mr. Fu.

307
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:30,640
Have you been drinking?

308
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:34,560
You're the one
who has been drinking.

309
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:36,120
Coming right up to sniff me...

310
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:38,680
No one sober would do such a thing.

311
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,080
I didn't mean any harm.

312
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:44,600
You have a shoot tomorrow.

313
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,120
I just wanted to remind you...

314
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:48,840
that alcohol can cause puffiness.

315
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,080
I told you, I didn't drink.

316
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,440
How long do you plan...

317
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:16,880
to keep your eyes closed?

318
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:31,760
Have I said that before?

319
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:55,799
How long do you plan...

320
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:56,800
to keep your eyes closed?

321
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:00,240
How much longer do you plan...

322
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,680
to sit here?

323
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:06,960
No way.

324
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:11,960
Mr. Fu,

325
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,280
long time no see.

326
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:19,000
It's her?

327
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:51,360
What bad luck.

328
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:53,440
Why would I have a dream like that?

329
00:18:55,600 --> 00:18:57,040
Others rely on their masters' power,

330
00:18:57,720 --> 00:18:58,760
but he relies on his doggone power!

331
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,000
Mr. Fu,

332
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:30,800
good morning.

333
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:32,720
Morning.

334
00:20:16,760 --> 00:20:18,400
What are you doing?
Stealing my headphones?

335
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:19,840
No.

336
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,160
I think we should talk.

337
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,880
I feel like you're hostile
toward me.

338
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:26,160
Correct.

339
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:27,400
I'm "Fu-phobic".

340
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:41,800
Hello, Mr. Fu.

341
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:02,000
Don't bark.

342
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:06,840
I'm sorry. Did that scare you?

343
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,200
It's okay.

344
00:21:08,560 --> 00:21:09,600
Liu Liu doesn't bite people.

345
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:21,400
Are you afraid of dogs?

346
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:24,720
I was bitten when I was a kid.

347
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:33,680
Mr. Fu.

348
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:42,240
Over there.

349
00:21:42,360 --> 00:21:43,360
Wipe it.

350
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,080
There's more on the back.

351
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,400
Let me help you.

352
00:22:25,560 --> 00:22:26,560
That's enough.

353
00:22:26,800 --> 00:22:28,520
- It's all wiped off.
- Thank you.

354
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:32,600
I'll give you a ride
since it's on the way.

355
00:22:33,760 --> 00:22:34,760
Okay.

356
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:36,040
Then thank you.

357
00:22:57,840 --> 00:22:58,840
By the way, Mr. Fu.

358
00:22:58,880 --> 00:23:00,720
Yesterday afternoon, Mr. Qin...

359
00:23:01,360 --> 00:23:03,119
sent someone to deliver
an invitation to your office.

360
00:23:03,120 --> 00:23:04,440
He's getting married
on the 7th next month.

361
00:23:04,680 --> 00:23:05,680
Will you be attending?
Which Mr. Qin?

362
00:23:07,120 --> 00:23:08,120
The one who is...

363
00:23:08,121 --> 00:23:09,640
the son of Zhengxi Steel's chairman,

364
00:23:10,040 --> 00:23:11,040
Qin Jia Hang.

365
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,920
As for the bride,

366
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:14,280
she was a flight attendant
from our company.

367
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:15,400
Do you remember?
The one in first class...

368
00:23:16,960 --> 00:23:18,880
who accidentally spilled coffee
all over herself.

369
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:25,200
She certainly has her ways.

370
00:23:31,840 --> 00:23:33,120
Do you no longer want to be...

371
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:34,240
a flight attendant at Hengshi?

372
00:23:35,440 --> 00:23:36,800
I don't want to be
a flight attendant anymore.

373
00:23:37,360 --> 00:23:38,680
- I want to be...
- The boss's wife?

374
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:41,040
You're better off dreaming.

375
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:48,680
I heard that...

376
00:23:49,880 --> 00:23:51,799
Mr. Qin doesn't seem very happy...

377
00:23:51,800 --> 00:23:52,800
about this wedding.

378
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:54,120
He said it was done
without his consent.

379
00:23:54,360 --> 00:23:56,360
So I thought maybe you...

380
00:23:56,520 --> 00:23:57,520
I won't be going.

381
00:23:57,880 --> 00:23:58,880
Decline it for me.

382
00:23:58,920 --> 00:23:59,920
Got it. Understood.

383
00:24:17,360 --> 00:24:18,360
This car...

384
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:20,160
is a bit hot.

385
00:24:22,120 --> 00:24:23,960
Ms. Ruan, here.
Would you like some water?

386
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:26,920
I'll open it for you.

387
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:27,960
I'll do it.

388
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,240
Let me.

389
00:24:31,520 --> 00:24:32,520
What strength.

390
00:24:35,880 --> 00:24:37,720
As expected of a woman
who can send people to the sky.

391
00:24:39,720 --> 00:24:41,120
I can also send people
to their graves.

392
00:25:22,320 --> 00:25:23,320
If you're upset,

393
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:24,680
just snap at me a few times.

394
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:25,960
You'll feel better.

395
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:27,880
I'm sorry, Mr. Fu.

396
00:25:28,280 --> 00:25:30,120
I'm a very straightforward person.

397
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:31,520
I didn't mean any harm.

398
00:25:31,800 --> 00:25:32,880
You won't take it to heart, right?

399
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:34,480
Of course not.

400
00:25:35,320 --> 00:25:36,400
But you shouldn't wear it
on your face.

401
00:25:52,800 --> 00:25:54,000
Please stop the car up ahead.

402
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:55,200
I'll get off there.

403
00:25:55,320 --> 00:25:56,439
Ms. Ruan, we're not there yet.

404
00:25:56,440 --> 00:25:58,320
I know. I'll just get off up ahead.

405
00:25:58,960 --> 00:25:59,960
There are too many people
at the gate.

406
00:26:00,040 --> 00:26:01,040
I want to avoid any gossip.

407
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:02,480
That's not necessary.

408
00:26:04,560 --> 00:26:05,560
What do you mean?

409
00:26:05,920 --> 00:26:07,199
I don't think our relationship is
at a stage...

410
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:08,200
where we need to avoid gossip.

411
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:45,000
Why is he walking so fast?

412
00:26:45,720 --> 00:26:47,320
Are those legs borrowed?
Is he in a hurry to return them?

413
00:26:47,600 --> 00:26:49,680
Ms. Ruan,
the shoot is about to start.

414
00:26:49,920 --> 00:26:50,920
I'll take you there first.

415
00:26:56,800 --> 00:26:57,800
Come in.

416
00:27:00,520 --> 00:27:01,920
Mr. Fu, here's Ruan Si Xian's file.

417
00:27:03,120 --> 00:27:04,120
Wait.

418
00:27:07,080 --> 00:27:08,880
Have you read the file?

419
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:10,160
No.

420
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:12,360
Do you think
Bai Yang knows about this?

421
00:27:12,560 --> 00:27:13,560
He has always known.

422
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:15,360
Didn't you say you haven't read it?

423
00:27:15,560 --> 00:27:16,759
I haven't.

424
00:27:16,760 --> 00:27:17,760
But I don't need to.
I've always known too.

425
00:27:21,120 --> 00:27:22,640
Mr. Fu, if there's nothing else,
I'll head out.

426
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:39,640
(Employee Registration Form,
Ruan Si Xian)

427
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:48,040
(Hengshi Air, Jiangcheng HQ,
Inflight Services, Division Four)

428
00:27:57,640 --> 00:27:58,640
Aren't we taking photos?

429
00:27:59,320 --> 00:28:00,360
Why did you bring me
to the warehouse?

430
00:28:01,600 --> 00:28:03,040
This is our photographer's idea.

431
00:28:03,600 --> 00:28:04,600
This warehouse is huge.

432
00:28:04,880 --> 00:28:06,200
We need the space
to get the best shots.

433
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:09,040
Xiao Ruan,
thanks for your hard work.

434
00:28:09,080 --> 00:28:10,200
Sorry for calling you in so early.

435
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:12,160
Xiao Ruan, let me
formally introduce you.

436
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:13,519
This is the manager
of our Publicity Department,

437
00:28:13,520 --> 00:28:14,520
Mr. Zeng Yu.

438
00:28:15,080 --> 00:28:16,720
- Nice to meet you.
- Hello.

439
00:28:17,080 --> 00:28:18,119
Xiao Ruan needs no introduction.

440
00:28:18,120 --> 00:28:19,920
No need for that.
She really is a beauty.

441
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:21,520
Shall we get started?

442
00:28:22,160 --> 00:28:23,200
- Let's go.
- This way.

443
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:25,280
- Come on.
- Let's get your makeup done first.

444
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:27,000
Actually, makeup or not,
it doesn't matter.

445
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:28,720
You're a natural beauty.

446
00:28:28,920 --> 00:28:29,920
You look like a star.

447
00:28:31,280 --> 00:28:32,280
Come over here.

448
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:34,960
Do a good job.

449
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:39,960
Tell her about it, Mr. Zeng.

450
00:28:41,320 --> 00:28:43,519
Okay, Xiao Ruan,
while you're getting ready,

451
00:28:43,520 --> 00:28:46,359
I'll quickly brief you
on the whole plan.

452
00:28:46,360 --> 00:28:48,240
Look here, this plan...

453
00:28:48,320 --> 00:28:50,240
was specially designed by Mr. Fu...

454
00:28:50,360 --> 00:28:51,360
to introduce the new aircraft model.

455
00:28:51,440 --> 00:28:53,160
It'll launch on the day
of the inaugural flight.

456
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:55,280
Once this campaign is out,

457
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:56,959
the "Flower of Hengshi" label...

458
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:58,240
won't even compare to its impact.

459
00:28:58,360 --> 00:28:59,919
It'll be unprecedented.

460
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:00,920
- One of a kind.
- Wait a minute.
Unique.

461
00:29:03,800 --> 00:29:04,800
Is it just me?

462
00:29:05,680 --> 00:29:06,680
Where are the other pilots?

463
00:29:07,320 --> 00:29:08,640
I'm just an observer pilot.

464
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:13,040
Well, here's the thing, Xiao Ruan.

465
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:15,280
Everyone's schedules...

466
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,720
are all completely staggered.

467
00:29:16,800 --> 00:29:18,759
- You're the first one to shoot.
- Yes, that's right.

468
00:29:18,760 --> 00:29:20,720
And you're the most important one.

469
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:21,960
To be the lead in the campaign...

470
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:24,280
for Hengshi Air's
new aircraft model...

471
00:29:24,320 --> 00:29:25,320
is definitely...

472
00:29:25,560 --> 00:29:27,080
something to be proud of.

473
00:29:29,800 --> 00:29:30,800
So...

474
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:32,400
the real reason Mr. Fu...

475
00:29:33,520 --> 00:29:35,079
insisted on signing me...

476
00:29:35,080 --> 00:29:36,720
is for this?

477
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:45,640
I'm really sorry,

478
00:29:46,080 --> 00:29:47,080
but I'd like to ask,

479
00:29:47,120 --> 00:29:48,360
is Mr. Fu coming today?

480
00:29:48,800 --> 00:29:49,920
He...

481
00:29:50,760 --> 00:29:51,760
Well,

482
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:53,800
if all goes well,
he should be here soon.

483
00:29:54,080 --> 00:29:55,399
Then I'd like
to request a word with him.

484
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,400
Is that okay?

485
00:29:58,320 --> 00:29:59,439
I see. Don't worry.

486
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:00,640
I'll go out and make a call...

487
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:01,880
to put in the request, okay?

488
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,440
You start on your makeup first.

489
00:30:04,560 --> 00:30:05,560
Mr. Zeng,

490
00:30:06,160 --> 00:30:08,120
I'm not trying to be uncooperative
with your work.

491
00:30:08,640 --> 00:30:09,840
It's just that there are
some things...

492
00:30:10,160 --> 00:30:12,200
I'd like to clarify first.

493
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:14,000
I understand.

494
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:16,640
I understand.

495
00:30:18,800 --> 00:30:19,920
What's with the panic?

496
00:30:20,120 --> 00:30:21,640
Well, it's Ruan Si Xian.

497
00:30:22,760 --> 00:30:23,760
She...

498
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:26,200
I was just looking for her.

499
00:30:27,280 --> 00:30:28,280
That's great.

500
00:30:35,960 --> 00:30:36,960
Mr. Fu,

501
00:30:37,440 --> 00:30:38,840
I really don't like this feeling.

502
00:30:39,280 --> 00:30:40,320
I have to complain to you again.

503
00:30:40,560 --> 00:30:42,400
Is there something about the shoot
that you're unhappy with?

504
00:30:43,080 --> 00:30:44,080
Did you bring me back...

505
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:49,720
to Hengshi Air...

506
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,600
just for publicity purposes?

507
00:30:52,920 --> 00:30:53,920
Even if you did,

508
00:30:54,400 --> 00:30:56,080
you shouldn't make me the lead.

509
00:30:56,680 --> 00:30:58,360
Captain Fan Lei
and Captain Yue Yang...

510
00:30:58,560 --> 00:30:59,640
are both more suitable than me.

511
00:31:08,880 --> 00:31:09,880
What's wrong?

512
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:11,160
Are you feeling unwell?

513
00:31:11,360 --> 00:31:12,360
That's not important.

514
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:15,000
Mr. Fu, I just want to ask...

515
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:16,319
if we can change the filming plan.

516
00:31:16,320 --> 00:31:18,000
I'm asking you,
are you feeling unwell?

517
00:31:20,520 --> 00:31:21,520
I was fine just now.

518
00:31:22,440 --> 00:31:24,600
Bai Yang, take Ruan Si Xian back
to her apartment.

519
00:31:25,160 --> 00:31:26,960
Stop today's shoot for now.

520
00:31:28,320 --> 00:31:30,560
What? Take her back
in my car to rest.

521
00:31:30,800 --> 00:31:32,240
Whether I rest or not
isn't important.

522
00:31:32,840 --> 00:31:35,280
What's important is
that you listen to what I'm saying.

523
00:31:53,920 --> 00:31:56,000
I won't make the same mistake
a second time.

524
00:32:00,240 --> 00:32:01,240
"The same..."

525
00:32:01,920 --> 00:32:03,000
"mistake"?

526
00:32:04,600 --> 00:32:05,920
I'll listen to everything you say.

527
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,000
Go back and get some rest first.

528
00:32:10,000 --> 00:32:11,720
I'll adjust
the photo shoot plan later.

529
00:32:17,040 --> 00:32:18,040
Go on.

530
00:32:18,440 --> 00:32:19,440
Bai Yang.

531
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:21,680
Ms. Ruan.

532
00:32:22,520 --> 00:32:23,520
Let me take you back.

533
00:32:28,600 --> 00:32:29,600
Let's go.

534
00:32:43,440 --> 00:32:45,600
I really don't understand.

535
00:32:46,280 --> 00:32:48,640
He's the one who provoked you.
Why are you torturing me?

536
00:32:48,760 --> 00:32:50,280
How am I torturing you?

537
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:51,599
You said it yourself.

538
00:32:51,600 --> 00:32:53,520
Whenever I'm unhappy, you will
come out and play with me.

539
00:32:53,840 --> 00:32:54,840
Then let's play.

540
00:32:54,920 --> 00:32:56,239
Let's do something relaxing
and artistic.

541
00:32:56,240 --> 00:32:57,600
How about it?
Like playing golf or something.

542
00:32:57,880 --> 00:33:00,000
This is so intense.
I've really never done this before.

543
00:33:00,640 --> 00:33:02,159
Do you know
that it has another name?

544
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:03,759
It's called "ballet on the wall".

545
00:33:03,760 --> 00:33:04,760
How artistic is that?

546
00:33:04,800 --> 00:33:05,880
Just climb.

547
00:33:06,600 --> 00:33:07,600
Let's go.

548
00:33:08,640 --> 00:33:09,640
Protect me.

549
00:33:10,040 --> 00:33:12,440
I didn't provoke anyone.

550
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:14,279
I didn't provoke anyone either.

551
00:33:14,280 --> 00:33:15,920
Why should I deserve to be stood up?

552
00:33:16,800 --> 00:33:18,320
All right, what are you looking at?

553
00:33:18,840 --> 00:33:19,840
Chalk up and get on the wall.

554
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:22,000
Isn't it because you were willing?

555
00:33:22,240 --> 00:33:23,960
Fu Ming Yu just had
to crook his finger,

556
00:33:24,280 --> 00:33:26,240
and you eagerly went running to him.

557
00:33:26,280 --> 00:33:27,520
You've been like this
since childhood.

558
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:28,760
You'll never change.

559
00:33:28,960 --> 00:33:30,920
I only came back this time
for the money.

560
00:33:31,200 --> 00:33:32,519
As if I'd believe that.

561
00:33:32,520 --> 00:33:33,720
Do you lack money, Zheng You An?

562
00:33:34,120 --> 00:33:36,239
If you really had any backbone,
I'd buy you a ticket right now.

563
00:33:36,240 --> 00:33:37,480
Would you be willing to fly back?

564
00:33:37,640 --> 00:33:39,479
Is the route I chose for you
not difficult enough?

565
00:33:39,480 --> 00:33:41,440
How can you still be so sarcastic
while you're on the wall?

566
00:33:41,840 --> 00:33:43,199
If I'm unwilling,
it's because of the money.

567
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:44,320
Who cares about him?

568
00:33:44,800 --> 00:33:45,800
Besides,

569
00:33:45,840 --> 00:33:47,440
my feelings for him are long gone.

570
00:33:47,760 --> 00:33:49,319
That childhood filter...

571
00:33:49,320 --> 00:33:50,320
is almost completely gone now.

572
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:52,080
I don't believe in...

573
00:33:53,040 --> 00:33:55,280
platonic friendships
between men and women.

574
00:33:56,320 --> 00:33:57,360
Aren't we exactly that?

575
00:33:59,520 --> 00:34:01,639
- Let go.
- I... I don't dare to let go!

576
00:34:01,640 --> 00:34:02,999
Your feet are
almost touching the ground.

577
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,200
Just let go. It's fine.

578
00:34:07,440 --> 00:34:08,440
Stop pretending.

579
00:34:08,640 --> 00:34:10,840
Fu Ming Yu, oh, Fu Ming Yu.

580
00:34:13,400 --> 00:34:14,400
Liar!

581
00:34:16,080 --> 00:34:17,080
Take it easy.

582
00:34:17,081 --> 00:34:18,400
You're going to break my drum.

583
00:34:19,200 --> 00:34:22,080
Are you fine now
after taking those painkillers?

584
00:34:23,720 --> 00:34:25,960
Thanks for the painkillers
and the pads, Xuan.

585
00:34:26,680 --> 00:34:27,720
But tell me,

586
00:34:28,200 --> 00:34:29,240
Isn't Fu Ming Yu...

587
00:34:29,440 --> 00:34:30,760
just a total fraud?

588
00:34:31,400 --> 00:34:33,400
I remember
downloading an anti-fraud app.

589
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:34,840
Even that couldn't stop him.

590
00:34:36,080 --> 00:34:38,200
A scammer has to steal something.

591
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:40,040
What did he scam you out of?

592
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:41,800
Your money?

593
00:34:42,040 --> 00:34:43,159
As I recall,

594
00:34:43,160 --> 00:34:45,000
he gave you
double the relocation allowance.

595
00:34:46,040 --> 00:34:47,080
Or did he...

596
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:49,600
scam you out of your feelings?

597
00:34:49,720 --> 00:34:51,240
He scammed me out of my dream!

598
00:34:51,880 --> 00:34:53,079
He used double
the relocation allowance...

599
00:34:53,080 --> 00:34:54,560
and the Z101 to lure me in.

600
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:57,520
Who could resist
such a huge temptation?

601
00:34:58,000 --> 00:34:59,160
A high-level scammer...

602
00:34:59,680 --> 00:35:01,120
knows exactly what we want.

603
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:02,280
He hit me where it hurts.

604
00:35:02,840 --> 00:35:04,600
Actually, I think it's fine.

605
00:35:05,160 --> 00:35:08,120
Representing Hengshi
to promote the Z101...

606
00:35:08,600 --> 00:35:09,600
is such a great opportunity.
So many people would kill for it.

607
00:35:11,520 --> 00:35:12,520
I don't have that chance.

608
00:35:13,120 --> 00:35:14,360
If I could go,

609
00:35:14,760 --> 00:35:17,280
I would pray
to the gods every day...

610
00:35:17,800 --> 00:35:20,160
to let my career take off.

611
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:21,320
I'll trade with you.

612
00:35:21,400 --> 00:35:22,400
You can have the "takeoff".

613
00:35:23,720 --> 00:35:24,720
Seriously.

614
00:35:24,760 --> 00:35:27,520
Promoting the Z101 is fine.

615
00:35:28,200 --> 00:35:29,960
Exploiting the surplus value
of workers...

616
00:35:30,160 --> 00:35:32,160
is exactly what Fu Ming Yu would do.

617
00:35:32,320 --> 00:35:33,519
But he can't use my dream...

618
00:35:33,520 --> 00:35:35,360
to trick me into joining,

619
00:35:35,600 --> 00:35:36,600
only to tell me later...

620
00:35:36,640 --> 00:35:38,360
that I'm just a gimmick to him.

621
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:39,800
You're overthinking it.

622
00:35:40,240 --> 00:35:41,439
I think,

623
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:43,560
since the result is the same,

624
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:45,760
is it really necessary
to care about how he phrased it?

625
00:35:45,960 --> 00:35:47,280
Of course it is!

626
00:35:47,960 --> 00:35:49,800
He's desecrating my dream.

627
00:35:50,320 --> 00:35:51,320
Besides,

628
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:54,200
even for promoting the Z101,

629
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:56,520
a rookie like me shouldn't
get the chance.

630
00:35:57,720 --> 00:35:58,999
Stop dreaming.

631
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:01,679
Reality is about to hit you
right in the face.

632
00:36:01,680 --> 00:36:03,440
We have a customer.
I'll head down first.

633
00:36:04,240 --> 00:36:05,360
You take a break.

634
00:36:05,960 --> 00:36:07,640
I'll go help Xuan.

635
00:36:21,080 --> 00:36:22,520
So you knew all along...

636
00:36:23,120 --> 00:36:24,120
who she was.

637
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:26,000
Yes.

638
00:36:26,440 --> 00:36:27,440
Three years ago,

639
00:36:27,720 --> 00:36:28,840
on the trip to Ma'ao,

640
00:36:29,520 --> 00:36:31,000
she was on that flight.

641
00:36:33,360 --> 00:36:35,280
She served you coffee...

642
00:36:36,240 --> 00:36:37,240
several times.

643
00:36:37,840 --> 00:36:38,840
Do you...

644
00:36:39,800 --> 00:36:41,080
Do you remember now?

645
00:36:42,720 --> 00:36:44,080
I don't want to be
a flight attendant anymore.

646
00:36:44,640 --> 00:36:45,920
- I want to be...
- The boss's wife?

647
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:48,320
You're better off dreaming.

648
00:36:48,720 --> 00:36:50,640
Don't forget that
you're still in a Hengshi uniform.

649
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:52,760
Can't you have some consideration
for Hengshi's image?

650
00:36:53,520 --> 00:36:55,560
Mr. Fu, please take a look
at this letter.

651
00:36:56,440 --> 00:36:57,440
Once you read it,

652
00:36:57,520 --> 00:36:58,520
you'll understand everything.

653
00:37:01,040 --> 00:37:02,519
Later, at Alvin's party,

654
00:37:02,520 --> 00:37:03,520
she showed up there too.

655
00:37:03,800 --> 00:37:04,800
Didn't you...

656
00:37:05,920 --> 00:37:07,480
chat with her for a bit then?

657
00:37:08,680 --> 00:37:10,320
If I said today was
just a coincidence,

658
00:37:11,000 --> 00:37:12,000
would you believe me, Mr. Fu?

659
00:37:12,120 --> 00:37:13,120
Yes.

660
00:37:13,121 --> 00:37:14,280
I would even believe you could fly.

661
00:37:15,560 --> 00:37:17,320
I think you just don't want
to work hard at all.

662
00:37:20,480 --> 00:37:21,760
After the party,

663
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:23,920
she resigned.

664
00:37:25,520 --> 00:37:26,600
Mr. Fu, I actually...

665
00:37:27,120 --> 00:37:28,120
reminded you back then.

666
00:37:28,920 --> 00:37:30,999
When I was
organizing your work emails,

667
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:32,799
I noticed that during that time,
Ruan Si Xian had sent you...

668
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:34,280
nearly a dozen emails.

669
00:37:34,480 --> 00:37:35,680
They were all
about the Soar Initiative.

670
00:37:35,760 --> 00:37:38,039
At that time, she had already passed
the assessment for the initiative.

671
00:37:38,040 --> 00:37:40,160
And the aviation academy had
sent her an admission letter.

672
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:44,160
Later, when I saw her
at the aviation academy,

673
00:37:44,520 --> 00:37:45,520
I recognized her,

674
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:47,040
and that's when I remembered.

675
00:37:47,800 --> 00:37:48,800
Back then,

676
00:37:49,200 --> 00:37:51,360
it wasn't just you, Mr. Fu.

677
00:37:51,880 --> 00:37:53,200
Maybe all of us...

678
00:37:53,560 --> 00:37:54,560
had misunderstood Ruan Si Xian.

679
00:38:02,640 --> 00:38:04,440
She even passed the Soar Initiative.

680
00:38:05,640 --> 00:38:08,279
- Yes.
- She just wanted to be a pilot.

681
00:38:08,280 --> 00:38:09,759
She had no other intentions.

682
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:11,439
She just wanted to be a pilot.

683
00:38:11,440 --> 00:38:14,000
Since you knew
she wanted to be a pilot,

684
00:38:16,800 --> 00:38:18,560
why didn't you remind me sooner?

685
00:38:19,360 --> 00:38:21,440
Back at the aviation academy,

686
00:38:23,960 --> 00:38:24,960
Ruan Si Xian...

687
00:38:25,680 --> 00:38:26,680
threatened me.

688
00:38:27,200 --> 00:38:28,920
If Mr. Fu never
remembers who I am,

689
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:31,520
I hope you won't tell him, Mr. Bai.

690
00:38:31,840 --> 00:38:33,680
Because I don't want to have
anything to do with him.

691
00:38:37,640 --> 00:38:39,760
I can't believe she cares so much
about what happened three years ago.

692
00:38:40,080 --> 00:38:41,080
Quite the opposite,

693
00:38:41,200 --> 00:38:43,240
Mr. Fu, quite the opposite.

694
00:38:43,640 --> 00:38:45,519
Ruan Si Xian simply didn't
want you to feel...

695
00:38:45,520 --> 00:38:47,200
like you misunderstood her
or owed her...

696
00:38:47,240 --> 00:38:48,240
because of what happened back then.

697
00:38:48,800 --> 00:38:49,920
That's why she didn't mention it.

698
00:38:50,280 --> 00:38:51,280
She came to Hengshi...

699
00:38:51,760 --> 00:38:53,400
specifically
for that domestic aircraft.

700
00:38:53,560 --> 00:38:55,320
She wanted to rely on
her own hard work and ability.

701
00:38:57,160 --> 00:38:58,160
As for everything else,

702
00:38:59,560 --> 00:39:00,560
she has already moved on.

703
00:39:02,320 --> 00:39:03,320
Bai Yang.

704
00:39:06,360 --> 00:39:08,400
She snaps at me
every time she sees me.

705
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:11,480
Do you really think...

706
00:39:12,480 --> 00:39:13,480
she has moved on?

707
00:39:20,520 --> 00:39:22,680
I really think
you've been off your game lately.

708
00:39:23,200 --> 00:39:24,200
Have I?

709
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:25,440
I don't think so.

710
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:26,480
You're overthinking it.

711
00:39:28,600 --> 00:39:29,600
Is this the place?

712
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:32,000
This is the bar
that was recommended.

713
00:39:33,680 --> 00:39:34,800
It's quite lively.

714
00:39:39,080 --> 00:39:41,000
Good evening, you two.
Welcome aboard.

715
00:39:41,680 --> 00:39:42,680
Please sit anywhere you want.

716
00:39:43,520 --> 00:39:44,520
Then...

717
00:39:44,920 --> 00:39:45,920
How about over here?
It's quieter and less crowded.

718
00:39:47,600 --> 00:39:48,600
Okay, let's sit there.

719
00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:50,600
Thank you.

720
00:39:51,760 --> 00:39:52,760
Watch your step.

721
00:39:53,760 --> 00:39:54,760
Let's sit here then.

722
00:39:54,880 --> 00:39:55,880
Okay.

723
00:39:59,040 --> 00:40:00,040
Please have a seat.

724
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:06,080
Here is our menu.

725
00:40:06,200 --> 00:40:07,760
What would you like to drink?

726
00:40:08,040 --> 00:40:09,240
Are you the owner?

727
00:40:09,960 --> 00:40:10,960
Yes, I am.
Then there's no need to look.

728
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:13,000
We'll take your recommendation.

729
00:40:14,080 --> 00:40:15,080
I'll do the same as him.

730
00:40:15,760 --> 00:40:16,760
All right.

731
00:40:16,800 --> 00:40:19,920
We have a refreshing,
jasmine-flavored cocktail.

732
00:40:19,960 --> 00:40:21,080
It's called Pilot's Halo.

733
00:40:21,240 --> 00:40:23,120
It's perfect
for a beautiful lady like you.

734
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:24,440
And what about me?

735
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:26,880
For you, I recommend
the Captain Sully.

736
00:40:27,200 --> 00:40:28,920
It's a whiskey-based cocktail.

737
00:40:29,040 --> 00:40:30,040
Does that sound good to you?

738
00:40:30,240 --> 00:40:31,240
Sure, you decide.

739
00:40:31,360 --> 00:40:32,400
All right, please wait a moment.

740
00:40:39,720 --> 00:40:40,880
You said this was...

741
00:40:41,520 --> 00:40:42,800
a flight-themed bar.

742
00:40:44,320 --> 00:40:46,719
No wonder, when I heard her say,
"Welcome aboard,"

743
00:40:46,720 --> 00:40:47,800
I thought it was you saying it.

744
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:49,920
You seemed to enjoy hearing it.

745
00:40:51,160 --> 00:40:52,160
Well...

746
00:40:52,320 --> 00:40:53,560
But the way she said it...

747
00:40:53,640 --> 00:40:55,520
just doesn't sound
as good as when you say it.

748
00:40:55,760 --> 00:40:56,760
Oh, stop it.

749
00:40:58,080 --> 00:41:00,199
I've heard from the girls
in my crew for a long time...

750
00:41:00,200 --> 00:41:01,320
that there's a trendy bar here.

751
00:41:02,320 --> 00:41:03,400
Now that I'm here today,

752
00:41:03,760 --> 00:41:06,039
I see those girls don't
usually have great taste,

753
00:41:06,040 --> 00:41:07,760
but they have a good eye for bars.

754
00:41:12,160 --> 00:41:13,720
Here is your Pilot's Halo.

755
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:14,920
Thank you.
I've got it.

756
00:41:17,360 --> 00:41:19,040
Enjoy your drinks. Let me know
if you need anything else.

757
00:41:19,080 --> 00:41:20,080
Thank you.

758
00:41:22,480 --> 00:41:25,440
In particular,
the owner of this bar...

759
00:41:25,600 --> 00:41:26,680
is so beautiful, right?

760
00:41:27,600 --> 00:41:28,720
I think she's really good-looking.

761
00:41:36,240 --> 00:41:37,240
This drink isn't even that good.

762
00:41:38,480 --> 00:41:39,480
Really?

763
00:41:40,680 --> 00:41:41,680
Let me try.

764
00:41:45,520 --> 00:41:46,520
I think it's fine.

765
00:41:46,521 --> 00:41:47,599
Then drink your own.

766
00:41:47,600 --> 00:41:49,080
You have your own. Why drink mine?

767
00:41:53,880 --> 00:41:55,120
I have a question for you.

768
00:41:55,680 --> 00:41:58,560
This is a flight-themed bar,

769
00:41:59,160 --> 00:42:00,960
and it's very close to the airport.

770
00:42:01,640 --> 00:42:04,160
I'd imagine a lot of colleagues
would come here, right?

771
00:42:05,160 --> 00:42:06,280
I don't think so.

772
00:42:06,840 --> 00:42:07,959
For those of us in this industry,

773
00:42:07,960 --> 00:42:09,840
who wants to come here
and feel like they're still at work?

774
00:42:11,400 --> 00:42:14,000
Then are the two of us...

775
00:42:14,280 --> 00:42:15,280
working overtime now?

776
00:42:16,280 --> 00:42:17,280
The two of us?

777
00:42:17,720 --> 00:42:19,000
The two of us are on a date.

778
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:32,000
This drink really is mediocre.

779
00:42:33,520 --> 00:42:35,319
The decor is okay,

780
00:42:35,320 --> 00:42:37,359
but neither of us likes the drinks.

781
00:42:37,360 --> 00:42:38,680
And the band is too loud.

782
00:42:39,360 --> 00:42:40,360
How about this?

783
00:42:40,480 --> 00:42:42,320
There's a lounge downstairs
at my hotel.

784
00:42:42,680 --> 00:42:44,600
I have some wine stored there.
How about we go there for a drink?

785
00:42:44,880 --> 00:42:46,200
But I want to watch a performance.

786
00:42:46,680 --> 00:42:47,760
Does your lounge have performances?

787
00:42:48,400 --> 00:42:50,280
If you want to hear someone sing,
I'll sing for you.

788
00:42:50,440 --> 00:42:51,440
Then sing right now.

789
00:42:51,480 --> 00:42:52,480
Now?

790
00:42:53,520 --> 00:42:54,520
Are you sure?

791
00:42:57,840 --> 00:42:59,960
Which song should I sing?

792
00:43:00,800 --> 00:43:01,800
I'm just kidding.

793
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:03,480
I'm just teasing you.

794
00:43:03,960 --> 00:43:05,120
Actually, today,

795
00:43:05,840 --> 00:43:07,319
I just want it to be the two of us.

796
00:43:07,320 --> 00:43:09,440
Let's find a quiet place
just for the two of us...

797
00:43:10,000 --> 00:43:11,000
to have a good chat.

798
00:43:11,480 --> 00:43:12,480
Really.

799
00:43:15,120 --> 00:43:16,120
All right then.

800
00:43:16,360 --> 00:43:17,920
I'm going to the restroom.

801
00:43:18,400 --> 00:43:19,800
We'll leave
after we finish our drinks.

802
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:21,680
Sure, no problem. Hurry back.

803
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:22,880
Wait for me.

804
00:43:32,840 --> 00:43:33,920
Ruan Si Xian?

805
00:43:37,040 --> 00:43:38,040
Ms. Jiang.

806
00:43:39,800 --> 00:43:44,800
(Departing Ep. 3 for Ep. 4)
